OL,3,GNEWSAAI helped me discover grandad was
OL,4,Aa covert WW2 soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Mark Townsend was growing up, his
OL,7,Flate grandfather was always his hero.
OL,8,FBut his family knew very little about
OL,9,Fhis role in World War Two after he died
OL,10,Fin the final months of the conflict.
OL,12,FThere had always been rumours within
OL,13,FTownsend's family that Cyril Smith had
OL,14,Fbeen in some kind of special service.
OL,16,FOlder relatives said Smith used to
OL,17,Fdisappear for weeks on end but they did
OL,18,Fnot know where he went and he was not
OL,19,Fallowed to tell them.
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
