OL,3,GNEWSAAI helped me discover grandad was
OL,4,Aa covert WW2 soldier
OL,5,
OL,6,FTownsend spent 17 years searching for
OL,7,Finformation, but it was not until he
OL,8,Fused an AI engine that he was able to
OL,9,Funcover that Smith worked for a covert
OL,10,Foperation, planning to disrupt German
OL,11,Fforces.
